  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "description": "Declared public support rows (stable IDs). Mapping: support row → lab.compatibilityCases → veracodeCertification.cases. README is generated output — never source of truth.",
  "statusLifecycle": ["planned", "experimental", "beta", "stable"],
  "notes": {
    "coverageMeaning": "100% of the officially declared support matrix — not every application in existence.",
    "veracodeMeaning": "Veracode ✅ only when ALL required Pipeline Scan cases for that support row PASS. No version inference.",
    "representative": "Curated sanity set for main (cases with representative:true). Do not expand to every version.",
    "full": "Pipeline Scan profile=full = ALL Lab Compatibility Full cases (expectedCaseCount 61). veracodeCertification.cases remain packaging variants for public-row ✅.",
    "packagingVariants": "Distinct artifact shapes (e.g. JAR vs WAR) are separate required cases for public-row Veracode ✅ under the same support row.",
    "labFullParity": "Release certification runs Lab Pipeline E2E profile=full (1:1 with Lab Compatibility Full).",
    "java25": "Java 25 is treated as LTS (experimental Lab status until Pipeline evidence). Java 26 is current/non-LTS.",
    "ear": "EAR is detected by Discovery/Builder/Doctor but is not a public packaging promise — no Lab EAR fixture.",
    "quarkusMicronaut": "Framework labels (quarkus/spring/jakarta) without distinct Builder paths are Discovery metadata only; not expanded as official Lab product lines.",
    "javascriptRuntimes": "Node 20 = legacy compatibility; Node 22 = principal Veracode-supported target. Node 24/26 must not receive Veracode ✅ until Veracode documents support.",
    "javascriptWorkspace": "npm/yarn/pnpm workspaces are not Discovery/Builder branches — no Lab workspace fixture until product support is declared.",
    "javascriptSvelteKoa": "svelte is Discovery-detectable but not a public Afrika capability; Koa is not detected — neither is expanded without Feature Completeness.",
    "typescriptCompiler": "Action does not version-gate the TypeScript compiler; Veracode documents TypeScript 5 and earlier. Lab proves TS 4.9 (legacy) and TS 5.6 (current 5.x).",
    "typescriptFrameworks": "Declared TS frameworks: Node, Express, React TSX, Next.js TSX. NestJS/Angular/Vue/Svelte+TS are not public TypeScript product lines (nestjs-typescript orphan remains unwired).",
    "dotnetModernBoundaries": "Special scenarios use .NET 8 (LTS) + .NET 10 (current) for console/classlib/multi-project. ASP.NET Core / Web API also on .NET 9 (Veracode ASP.NET Core through 9.0). Do not invent ASP.NET Core 10 or Blazor WASM 10 Veracode PASS.",
    "dotnetModernArtifacts": "Action packages FDD ZIP of DLL/EXE/PDB (+ deps.json). NUPKG and SCD are not product lines. WPF/WinForms/Azure Functions are Discovery-detectable but not declared public support.",
    "dotnetModernLanguages": "C# and VB.NET are both declared; VB language branch covered once (vbnet @ net8).",
    "dotnetFrameworkScope": "Afrika declares .NET Framework 4.8 only (not 2.0–4.7). Lab covers Console, Class Library, Multi-project, VB.NET, and classic ASP.NET on windows-latest via MSBuild. packages.config is used for classic ASP.NET SCA only — not a separate restore product line. WPF/WinForms not productized."
  },
